"T=3141592653, P=26, base 10, modulus q=11. hash(P)=26 mod 11=4. Windows: 31→9, 14→3, 41→8, 15→4 (spurious), 59→4 (spurious), 92→4 (spurious), 26→4 (real match at shift 6), 65→10, 53→9.",
["Rolling hash: t_{s+1}=(d·(t_s − T[s+1]·h) + T[s+m+1]) mod q, h=d^{m−1} mod q.","Hash equal ⇒ verify characters (spurious hits possible).","Average/expected O(n+m); worst O(nm) with many spurious hits.","Good for multiple pattern search.","Choose a large prime q.","Preprocessing Θ(m)."],
