algorithmSteps=["1. Compute π for P.","2. q=0; for i in T: while q>0 and P[q+1]≠T[i]: q=π[q].","3. If P[q+1]=T[i] q++.","4. If q=m: report match at i−m; q=π[q]."],
pseudocode="ComputePrefix(P)\n  π[1] ← 0; k ← 0\n  for q ← 2 to m do\n    while k>0 and P[k+1]≠P[q] do k ← π[k]\n    if P[k+1]=P[q] then k ← k+1\n    π[q] ← k\nKMP(T,P)\n  q ← 0\n  for i ← 1 to n do\n    while q>0 and P[q+1]≠T[i] do q ← π[q]\n    if P[q+1]=T[i] then q ← q+1\n    if q=m then print i−m; q ← π[q]",
